#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:2334
msgid ""
"One IP or CIDR per line. Forwarded client headers are trusted only when REMOTE_ADDR matches this "
"list."
msgstr "每行一个 IP 或 CIDR。只有当 REMOTE_ADDR 匹配此列表时，才信任转发的客户端请求头。"

#: admin/class-ysec-admin-tables.php:226
msgid ""
"One absolute path per line. A trailing * means prefix match, for example /private-export/*. Up to"
" 100 rules."
msgstr "每行一个绝对路径。末尾 * 表示前缀匹配，例如 /private-export/*。最多 100 条规则。"

#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:1409
msgid "One clear authority for each layer"
msgstr "每层一个明确权限主体"

#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:1927
msgid ""
"One directive plus one or more origins per line. Exact origins and wildcard subdomains are "
"accepted; paths and query strings are deliberately excluded."
msgstr "每行一个指令加一个或多个来源。接受精确源和通配子域；有意排除路径和查询字符串。"

#: admin/class-ysec-admin-tables.php:226
msgid ""
"One exact METHOD + path per line, for example GET /known-safe-endpoint. These exceptions bypass "
"automatic firewall-profile matching only; explicit source blocks, Geo Security, rate containment,"
" virtual patches and manual deny rules still take precedence. Up to 100 exceptions."
msgstr ""
"每行一个精确 METHOD + 路径，例如 GET /known-safe-endpoint。这些例外仅绕过自动防火墙配置匹配；显式来源阻止、Geo "
"Security、速率隔离、虚拟补丁和手动拒绝规则仍优先。最多 100 个例外。"

#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:1253
msgid ""
"One guarded transaction: analyze the site, snapshot the current configuration, apply a "
"conservative protection profile, verify critical surfaces, then commit or automatically roll "
"back."
msgstr "一次受控事务：分析站点、快照当前配置、应用保守保护配置、验证关键表面，然后提交或自动回滚。"

#: admin/class-ysec-admin.php:1608
msgid ""
"One path per line, relative to WordPress root. Use a trailing * for a prefix. Do not ignore "
"application code merely to hide unexplained drift."
msgstr "每行一个相对 WordPress 根目录的路径。末尾使用 * 表示前缀。不要仅为隐藏无法解释的漂移而忽略应用代码。"

