msgstr "Yablonsky Security TOTP 按用户配置。仅当至少一个账户启用时，登录安全代码字段才会显示。"

#: includes/class-ysec-compatibility.php:51
msgid ""
"Yablonsky Security detected another active security plugin. Review overlapping protection layers "
"and assign one owner to each enforcement responsibility."
msgstr "Yablonsky Security 检测到另一个活动安全插件。请审查重叠保护层，并为每项强制责任指定一个所有者。"

#: includes/class-ysec-privacy.php:18
msgid ""
"Yablonsky Security records bounded security evidence needed to protect the site. Suspicious "
"request evidence can include a salted source identifier, an encrypted source IP, user agent, a "
"country signal supplied by a validated trusted proxy, and a redacted request query. Raw request "
"evidence expires automatically according to severity, while compact non-identifying daily rollups"
" can be kept longer for security trends. Firewall blocks are time-bounded and reversible. "
"Optional Yablonsky AI analysis is disabled by default and sends a structured evidence bundle only"
" when an administrator enables the integration and explicitly requests analysis."
msgstr ""
"Yablonsky Security 会记录保护站点所需的有界安全证据。可疑请求证据可能包括加盐来源标识符、加密来源 IP、User-"
"Agent、由已验证可信代理提供的国家信号，以及脱敏后的请求查询。原始请求证据会按严重性自动过期，而紧凑、非识别性的每日汇总可保留更久用于安全趋势。防火墙阻止有时间限制且可撤销。可选 "
"Yablonsky AI 分析默认关闭，仅在管理员启用集成并明确请求分析时才发送结构化证据包。"

